---
// Premium Identity Section with tilt cards, gradient borders, and glowing accents
---

<section class="py-28 relative overflow-hidden bg-cream-50 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]">
    <!-- Background decorative -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-primary-500/[0.03] rounded-full blur-[120px] -z-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-secondary-500/[0.03] rounded-full blur-[100px] -z-10"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch">
            <!-- Motto Card - Premium teal gradient -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-1 group reveal reveal-left">
                <div class="relative h-full">
                    <!-- Animated gradient border -->
                    <div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 via-accent-400 to-secondary-500 rounded-[2.5rem] opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-700 blur-sm"></div>
                    <div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-400 via-accent-400 to-secondary-500 rounded-[2.5rem] animate-gradient-shift opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500" style="background-size: 200% 200%;"></div>

                    <div class="relative h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-600 via-primary-700 to-secondary-700 rounded-[2.5rem] p-10 text-white flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden z-10">
                        <!-- Decorative elements inside -->
                        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 opacity-[0.07] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700">
                            <svg class="w-40 h-40" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5">
                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" />
                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30" />
                                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="15" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-32 h-32 bg-accent-400/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

                        <div class="relative">
                            <h3 class="text-white/50 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Our Motto</h3>
                            <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
                                Inspiring <br/>
                                <span class="text-primary-200">Excellence,</span> <br/>
                                Empowering <br/>
                                <span class="text-accent-300">Future Leaders.</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative mt-12">
                            <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-white/20 rounded-full"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vision/Values Grid -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- Visi -->
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary-500/5 transition-all duration-500 group reveal reveal-right" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-primary-100 dark:from-primary-900/30 dark:to-primary-900/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3 transition-transform duration-500 border border-primary-200/30 dark:border-primary-800/30">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3 tracking-tight">Visi Kami</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Menjadi lembaga pendidikan Islam terdepan yang menghasilkan generasi muslim yang berilmu, berakhlak mulia, dan berwawasan global.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Core Values -->
                <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-secondary-500/5 transition-all duration-500 group reveal reveal-right" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-50 to-secondary-100 dark:from-secondary-900/30 dark:to-secondary-900/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3 transition-transform duration-500 border border-secondary-200/30 dark:border-secondary-800/30">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3 tracking-tight">Core Values</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Integritas, Keunggulan, Karakter Islami, dan Semangat Inovasi dalam setiap aspek pendidikan.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Akreditasi - Full width -->
                <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent-500/5 transition-all duration-500 group reveal reveal-scale" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-6">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-400 to-accent-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3 transition-transform duration-500 shadow-lg shadow-accent-500/20">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2 tracking-tight">Akreditasi A</h4>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">
                                SMP ABBS Surakarta telah terakreditasi "A" (Sangat Baik) oleh BAN-S/M, menjamin standar kualitas pendidikan yang mumpuni.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
